My sample code is:

code=nimbleCode({
  for (i in 1:100) {
    beta0[i]~dnorm(0,1)
    for (j in 1:120) {
      y[i,j] ~ dnorm(u[i,j],tau)
      u=beta*x[i,j]+beta0[i]
    }
  }
  tau~dgamma(1,1)
  beta~dnorm(0,1)
})

I am wondering if anyone has any idea about this? Thanks!

